# C2 live stress (§50) — evidence

# Purpose: §48 removed UBSan instrumentation from the eight fallback `container_of`
# expressions; only `js_rc` (quickjs.c:1494) was exercised by the §49 live shot. This
# run drives the other seven — the free/realloc/usable-size sites — through a fixed JS
# stress script executed by the vendored QuickJS inside the game process, then checks
# the host survived the churn. This is the last unexercised risk surface of the §48 fix.
# Authorization: the human partner's standing "继续实机调试,之后不用问权限" (no per-shot
# prompt). Windows-side actions: scp, Get-FileHash, python — no debugger, no hooks, no
# byte edits, no game-file changes.
# exe identity: stellaris.exe 4.4.4 sha256
#   9242c40abb78b53e88039ead1270ad82eb003959fb2d413c856d280ea02b1a56 — same session as
#   §49 (pid 9932, main menu, never restarted, and left running after this shot).
# Artifact of record: stellaris_quickjs.dll sha256
#   938b6e15e0759d4fd8f5d47ae921550adeb3e5b762a17a2d6497a97a8fcd7777, deployed as
